  "actualVisualReview": {
    "reviewer": "state_art_completion",
    "notes": "Actually opened all11saved paired galleries (13drawings,156caps). Each native directional/ground-air/pickup body retains identity, attached limbs/ears/tail and fixedroot registration. Source12caps follow head/core/limbs/tailbase and sourceHave follows native mouth-contact point in each source orientation. Accepted walking/back/down lower endpoint flex preserves all native radii; no body lift/recentering or hidden baked items. Ground alphafloors pass; air-up tail intentionally extends belowroot and actual landing retirement remains to verify. Runtime bothfacings/sourceHave/control/input/pause/hitlag/floor evidence remains pending.",
